1
00:00:01,050 --> 00:00:04,870
AI agents are getting smarter,
faster, and better

2
00:00:04,950 --> 00:00:09,410
They browse the web, read your inbox,
write your code and book your flights

3
00:00:09,490 --> 00:00:11,080
Meet the Jippities

4
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:13,030
They can’t do any of that

5
00:00:13,110 --> 00:00:17,590
Each one is a whole lot of personality,
stuck in its own moment in time

6
00:00:17,670 --> 00:00:20,310
We built them for
Kiroween’s Costume Contest

7
00:00:20,390 --> 00:00:22,850
Every Jippity is a real AI chat

8
00:00:22,930 --> 00:00:24,870
dressed up as an app you used to love

9
00:00:24,950 --> 00:00:28,730
each with a nostalgic song
to match the vibes

10
00:00:28,810 --> 00:00:31,930
Meet Daisy. She only cares
about your a/s/l

11
00:00:32,010 --> 00:00:35,680
Kayleigh’s online after school,
until her mum needs the computer

12
00:00:35,760 --> 00:00:39,300
Cal can call you for free.
For about seven seconds

13
00:00:39,380 --> 00:00:42,470
Mark isn’t that Mark.
Please stop asking

14
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:46,420
Arthur has an answer for everything.
He’s kind of annoying like that

15
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:50,480
Channing made a channel for that.
And that. And that

16
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:54,250
Grug has rock.
Grug very proud of rock

17
00:00:54,330 --> 00:00:57,750
Mortimer doesn’t hallucinate.
He is the hallucination

18
00:00:58,120 --> 00:00:59,990
Shelly is not helpful

19
00:01:00,170 --> 00:01:02,620
Carol ships only one night a year

20
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:05,560
Cora is AGI… I think?

21
00:01:05,790 --> 00:01:09,530
And Lucky’s always got a good feeling
about the next one

22
00:01:09,610 --> 00:01:15,340
Try a Jippity today at gpty.lol,
and talk nonsense with some useless agents
